00:00:16.961 --> 00:00:21.276
fact Within the supplied delegation Daniel moves a routine

00:00:21.329 --> 00:00:26.210
internal administrative catch-up inside an agreed free period No

00:00:26.262 --> 00:00:31.670
protected commitment external undertaking cost or specialist dependency is

00:00:31.670 --> 00:00:36.711
